    /// 1. Compute the ASCII byte representation of `field_name` and call it `F`.

    /// 1. Concatenate (`S` and `F`) or (`S`, `V` and `F`) using `::` as separator and call it `C`.

    /// 1. Apply the `SHA2` 256-bit hash `H` of `C`.

